 "description": "GUIDE PRICE £240,000-£250,000 / NO ONWARD CHAIN\n\nParr Street is conveniently situated on the fringes of the City Centre, just a stones throw from a superb variety of amenities, as well as Exeter bus station, St James and St David's train station, St Sidwell's Leisure Centre and much more.\n\nThis charming home has been tastefully refurbished throughout, with a gorgeous living room to front, with wood-burner and stylish panelling.\nTo the rear you will find a beautifully designed kitchen with integrated appliances and breakfast bar.\n\nUpstairs hosts a generous principle bedroom with fitted wardrobes and feature fireplace along with further single room with contemporary shower room with large walk-in shower.\n\nOutside, the property enjoys a low maintenance rear garden with large shed. There is also direct access to a rear car park with permits available via the council.\n\nCouncil Tax Band: B\nTenure: Freehold",
